[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Overview

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The Main Control Bootloader firmware allows the system to update the main control application firmware.

The Main Control Bootloader firmware runs on the main control MCU of the main control board.
<<<

